{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite", "label": "Performance Suite \u2014 Load, Soak, Query-Plan Regression Budgets", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_prng", "label": "Deterministic seeded PRNG (mulberry32, prng.ts)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Root of every reproducibility guarantee in the suite; Math.random()/crypto.randomUUID() never appear in generators so buildFixturePlan is byte-identical across runs/machines for the same seed."}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_saturation_and_recovery", "label": "saturation-and-recovery scenario", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberately oversubscribes the real maintenance work-class gate, asserts the exact expected count of immediate 503 DATABASE_BUSY rejections, and confirms the gate drains back and recovers -- the concrete proof for Issue #743's saturation behavior."}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_query_plan_budgets", "label": "Query-plan regression budgets (query-plan-budgets.ts)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Versioned governance artifact of six real query shapes with forbidden/required plan node types and numeric budgets; the only way to widen a budget is a reviewable source diff with explicit approval metadata."}, {"id": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_adversarial_proof", "label": "Adversarial proof of query-plan gate (forced-planner-GUC test)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A checker only ever exercised against good input proves nothing about catching real regressions; forcing planner GUCs (disabling index/bitmap scans) reproduces a real missing-index incident against actual PostgreSQL rather than a hand-built fixture."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_prng", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_saturation_and_recovery", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_query_plan_budgets", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_adversarial_proof", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_awcms_micro_performance_suite_saturation_and_recovery", "target": "docs_awcms_micro_database_pooling_work_class_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/awcms-micro/performance-suite.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs